<title>SPAIN: FORECAST - Repsol Q1 attributable seen down 2.9 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Repsol Q1 attributable seen down 2.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a consensus of analyst forecasts for first quarter results at Spanish energy group Repsol, (in billions of pesetas).</p>
<p>				 Q1 1997    Q1 1996	RANGE</p>
<p> Operating profit	  57.30	53.12     56.98-60.41</p>
<p> Attributable profit     34.40	35.41     33.43-35.80</p>
<p>CONTRIBUTORS: Argentaria, BCH, Beta Capital and three energy analysts who requested anonymity.</p>
<p>Repsol may announce first quarter results on Tuesday May 13 or on Wednesday May 14.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
